#: templates/sosoblue/household.html:109
msgid ""
"An age limit hides content rated above it from that member, and prevents "
"marking it as watched for them. Ratings come from TMDB, French ones first."
msgstr ""
"Une limite d'âge masque à ce membre les contenus classés au-dessus, et "
"empêche de les marquer comme vus pour lui. Les classifications viennent de "
"TMDB, en priorité la française."

